    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5069" root="جثم" body-key="j">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُثَامٌ</span></b>  <i>Incubus,</i> or <i>nightmare;</i> (T, K;) <i>what
comes upon a man when he is sleeping;</i> (T, TA;)
<i>what comes upon a man in the night, preventing
him from speaking; i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَيْدُلَانٌ</span>; (IAar, TA;)
as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَاثُومٌ</span></b>  (T, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَثَّامَةٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُثَمٌ</span></b> 
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُثَمَةٌ</span></b> . (T, TA.)

